test.yaml:11:16: this step checks out code from a pull request (github.event.pull_request.head.sha) in a "pull_request_target" workflow and reviewdog/action-eslint runs it afterwards. the workflow has a write token and secrets, so whoever controls that code can use them. run untrusted code in a "pull_request" workflow without secrets, or check out the base branch and only read the pull request as data. the pinned actions/checkout (v4.2.2) predates the protection that refuses the code of a fork pull request here, upgrade to v4.4.0 or later [untrusted-checkout]
